Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: example/reader4.c
Line: 46
Function: processDoc
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: docPtr->URL is read into URL and explicitly checked for NULL at lines 40-43, but the function continues and passes URL to fprintf with "%s" here when ret != 0. If URL is NULL, this results in a NULL pointer dereference in fprintf.

